<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Shangri-La 1996 net down 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Shangri-La 1996 net down 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  68.49   vs	  77.43</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 15.6    vs	  17.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		   279.70   vs	 298.81</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    93.76   vs	 107.76</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   2.89   vs  less   3.81</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries   less  13.80   vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)	    6.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Shangri-La Hotels (Malaysia) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
